Output demo/demo.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 960
Set Height 600
Set TypingSpeed 50ms
Set Theme {"name": "oc-relay", "black": "#0b0e14", "red": "#e06c75", "green": "#98c379", "yellow": "#e5c07b", "blue": "#61afef", "magenta": "#c678dd", "cyan": "#56b6c2", "white": "#d7dae0", "brightBlack": "#7f848e", "brightWhite": "#ffffff", "background": "#0b0e14", "foreground": "#d7dae0", "cursor": "#61afef", "cursorAccent": "#0b0e14", "selectionBackground": "#3a4151"}

Hide
Type "cd /oc-relay && npm run build >/dev/null 2>&1 && clear"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Type@50ms "DEMO_PACE=2 node demo/demo.mjs"
Enter
Wait /the work follows you/
Sleep 5s
